message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Smoking Pi"
abstract: >-
  Home and small-network latency monitoring on a Raspberry Pi: SmokePing
  probes exported to InfluxDB or ClickHouse, Grafana dashboards, an alerting
  engine with microcut detection, and an MCP server that lets an AI assistant
  answer questions about the connection.
